  "name": "Deep Blue Hotel & Hot Springs",
  "locationString": "Warrnambool, Victoria",
  "description": "The Deep Blue Hotel & Hot Springs is your destination to Relax, Rejuvenate & Replenish. With over 80 well-appointed guest rooms—each with its own private balcony—and impressive Penthouse Apartments offering stunning ocean views, the hotel is designed to fulfil your holiday dreams. Unwind in the Hot Springs Sanctuary, where geothermal rock pools, sensory caves, and waterfalls invite you to soak in naturally therapeutic geothermal waters rich in restorative minerals. Treat yourself to a relaxing massage or indulge in organic facials and body treatments at the Day Spa. Experience the benefits of Halotherapy in our Salt Room. Start your day with a delicious buffet breakfast and wind down in the evening with our chef's signature degustation menu. Perfectly located on the scenic Warrnambool foreshore, the hotel is surrounded by coastal walking and cycling trails and is just steps from some of the best beaches along the Great Ocean Road, including Warrnambool’s main swimming beach.",
